flowchart LR
  %% 分层：前端、服务、第三方
  subgraph Client[前端 Web 应用（Vue 3 + Vite）]
    Router[Vue Router]
    Store[Pinia Store]
    UI[Views & Components]
    Home[主页/推荐侧栏导航]
    Map[地图与三维可视化]
    Weather[天气模块]
    Voice[语音助手]
    Chat[AI 聊天（LKE / Appflow）]
    Video[视频识别]
    Evac[火灾疏散模拟]
    Workers[Web Workers]
    subgraph MapFeatures[地图图层与工具]
      Pipelines[地下管线/剖面/挖方/导出]
  Floor[楼层抽屉]
      Facilities[设施/灭火器]
      Pano[全景红点]
      Curves[园区→目的地曲线]
    end
  end

  subgraph Services[本地/后台服务]
    TokenSrv[Token 签发服务\nserver/lke-token-server.mjs]
    LogisticsSrv[物流数据服务\nserver/logistics-server.mjs]
  end

  subgraph Integrations[第三方 / 外部系统]
    QWeather[(和风天气 API)]
    AMapJS[高德 JS SDK]
    AMapREST[(高德 REST)]
    LKE[(LKE 平台 WS / SSE)]
    Appflow[(Appflow Chat)]
    MediaAssets[(模型 / 运行时资源\nMediaPipe / ONNX Runtime Web)]
  end

  Dev[(Vite Dev / Build)] --> Client

  UI --> Router
  UI --> Store
  UI --> Map
  UI --> Weather
  UI --> Voice
  UI --> Chat
  UI --> Video
  UI --> Home
  UI --> Evac
  Home -- 入口导航 --> Weather

  Weather --> QWeather
  Map --> AMapJS
  Map --> AMapREST

  Chat --> LKE
  Chat --> Appflow
  Chat --> TokenSrv

  Voice --> Chat

  Video --> Workers
  Workers --> MediaAssets
  Evac --> MediaAssets

  LogisticsSrv -- 数据供给 --> UI
  Map --> MapFeatures

  subgraph Data[本地/静态数据]
    StaticData[(JSON/GeoJSON/CSV)]
  end
  MapFeatures --> StaticData
